  "v1": {
    "2": "THE DOOR, AND THE FIRST WINDFALL. ⭐ The letter said \"It shows me the windfalls arrive. It does not show me which door they come through.\" THIS ROOM IS THE DOOR — name it in ordinary words, say what the first windfall actually is, and say how she would recognise it arriving. ⛔ Whatever card stands here decides the SHAPE of it, never whether it comes: a hard card means the money arrives awkwardly, late, or through something she would rather not touch — it does not mean there is no windfall. She is holding the letter that promised one. ⛔ And no date on it: the letter promised her the door, not the day.",
    "5": "THE LOVE ANSWER, AND IT IS THE ONE SHE WILL CHECK HARDEST. ⭐ The letter gave her two readings and refused to choose: \"the serpent tree is appetite… the tree of flames is the thing that's lastingly alive for you. Both feel exactly like love in the first weeks. One of them costs you a year.\" THIS ROOM SEPARATES THEM — the letter says so itself, \"the house the Lovers falls into is what separates them\". Say WHICH, flat, and say how the card standing here decided it. ⭐ THEN PAY THAT BRANCH AND ONLY THAT ONE — they contradict each other, so never both. RENEWAL (something she already holds) → pay the letter's flat promise: \"the person on your mind is going to become more attentive toward you than they have ever been.\" Say by when, and what the first sign of it looks like. ARRIVAL (not yet in her hands) → this is the offer's own name: say the words TWIN FLAME, name the week he comes, and DESCRIBE HIM. ⛔ He is NOT a stranger — the letter is flat about it: \"the encounter the second reading points to is not a stranger. It's someone you already know.\" ⛔ And \"ordinary clothes on an ordinary day\" is the LETTER's line about what he is NOT; handing it back to her is not an answer. Say how he carries himself and what he is in the middle of when she meets him — the standard's own model: he is not looking for her, he is going somewhere, she is on the way, and he stops. Manner, never features, never lightning. ⭐ And make the letter's distinction: a twin flame ARRIVING and a twin flame RECOGNISED are two different events, and women miss theirs because they are braced for the wrong thing. ⛔⛔ ARGUE IT FROM THE TABLE — name the card standing in house 7 (who you are bound to) or house 11 (your circle) and show what it does to the answer. A card going nowhere in house 7 is the reason there is no renewal available to be handed her. A verdict with nothing behind it reads as a coin toss she paid thirty-five dollars to watch.",
